# Toolkit — Audit Automation Scripts

## Location
```
D:/data hermes/bug-bounty/bundle/toolkit/
```

## Scripts
```
shared/finding_gate.py    — Filter candidates → survivors (anti-overclaim)
shared/chain_builder.py   — Chain weak findings → stronger impact
web2/idor_harness.py      — Automated IDOR testing (2 accounts)
web2/scope_narrower.py    — Rank targets by attack value
web3/diff_vs_upstream.py  — Audit diff against upstream repo
web3/invariant_scaffold.py — Generate invariant test scaffolds
```

## Usage
```bash
# Finding gate (before report)
python D:/data hermes/bug-bounty/bundle/toolkit/shared/finding_gate.py findings.json --report REPORT-survivors.md

# Chain builder (escalation analysis)
python D:/data hermes/bug-bounty/bundle/toolkit/shared/chain_builder.py findings.json --goal account_takeover

# IDOR harness (2-account testing)
python D:/data hermes/bug-bounty/bundle/toolkit/web2/idor_harness.py setup -c profile.yaml
python D:/data hermes/bug-bounty/bundle/toolkit/web2/idor_harness.py verify

# Scope narrow (prioritize targets)
python D:/data hermes/bug-bounty/bundle/toolkit/web2/scope_narrower.py recon.txt --top 5
```
